    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I hear you on the \"consensus\" part, but it feels like when people bring up the biological side, they get dismissed as just being unscientific or bigoted. Is there a legitimate scientific reason to discount the binary view, or is it more of a social/political thing at this point? I want to make sure my kid understands if there's an actual factual basis for the disagreement.",
